# Renamed to .gitignore by `create`; a package drops dotfiles named .gitignore.
#
# No trailing slash: a symlinked node_modules (a linked local dependency) is not
# a directory, and `node_modules/` would let the link be committed.
node_modules

# The ready-built page (`bun run build`), stamped with the commit it was built from.
dist

# Written by `build.ts` for the length of a build and taken away after. Left
# behind by a killed build, it would be what Vite answers at `/`, with no
# ticket in it.
/index.html
